{%- comment -%}
  First Access — the campaign landing page.

  A .liquid template rather than .json because only a .liquid template can
  choose its layout, and this page's defining property is that it does NOT
  render the store chrome. `layout/first-access.liquid` is theme.liquid with
  the header, footer and cart drawer removed.

  The section itself stays a section, so its settings (hero image, the
  success-state preview) remain editable from the theme editor.

  NAMED -campaign RATHER THAN page.first-access.liquid because Shopify refuses
  two templates with the same name and different extensions, and the earlier
  page.first-access.json still exists on the theme. The page URL is unchanged
  — the handle is what a visitor sees, not the template suffix.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% layout 'first-access' %}

{% section 'first-access' %}
